<title>SINGAPORE: THAI BANGCHAK ISSUES TENDER TO BUY SEPTEMBER MTBE.</title>
<headline>THAI BANGCHAK ISSUES TENDER TO BUY SEPTEMBER MTBE.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thailand's Bangchak Petroleum Plc has issued a tender to buy 1,500 tonnes of methyl tertiary butyl ether (MTBE) for delivery in September, a company source said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The tender for the gasoline octane booster closes on August 13 and offers are valid to August 14.</p>
<p>In its last tender, Bangchak bought a cargo for August delivery at around $275 per tonne on a cost-and-freight basis to Thailand from Saudi Basic Industries Corp (SABIC).</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (+65 870 3093)</p>
